# Waitlist delivery uses FormSubmit.co — no account, no API key.
# By default submissions go to fulcrumretailsolutions@gmail.com (hardcoded in
# app/components/Waitlist.jsx). The inbox owner clicks "Activate" once on the
# first email FormSubmit sends, and every submission is delivered after that.
#
# OPTIONAL: after activation, FormSubmit gives you a private aliased endpoint
# (https://formsubmit.co/ajax/<random-string>) that keeps the email address out
# of the public page source. Set it here (local) and in Vercel to use it.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FORMSUBMIT_ENDPOINT=https://formsubmit.co/ajax/your-random-string
